<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">BaGalati</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaGa</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaGalati</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aGalati</para>
  <para style="mt1">BaGalati</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aGalati</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">AShow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Kufumung ijɛk kang ne ni imi, aBulus, atom aYeso. Iyes hom ne na banet kɛ anet akak awo, tit na aYeso Kristi nɛ Ada Adakunom, fɛ́ a donong aYeso ni iku, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />na baruneng fi in se yit gung.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">In jɛk yit iko sak na bafi ikuus</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 1:2">fɛ́ ba se na aGalati.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Won itek ni kusonong kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa aYeso Kristi, ni ku sot kufiin, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />iwu fɛ́ a nɔɔk ice wu nek anɛn yit, nɔng a bin tun yit mo ni ibɔk kuzam kumaan e kang, kpaf ni ishim Ada nɛ Adakunom yit. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Won iratek ni isot ifuu ayɛ na ayɛ. Anɔng.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifɛ̀ itek ikak zɛɛt di se awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />A di te yɔɔt makiyi, fi i mi wat itirik yin ayɔng fɛ́ a ki yes yin nek itek fi ines na Anet-Isheshek, ni tirik yin sak ni ifɛ̀ ikak iduk e, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />idɔng fi da iyet ifɛ̀ itek awo. I se wɛshɛk fok banet bakak tsin ki boroso yin na ba shim ba ki tes natse ni ifɛ̀ itek ifɛ́ Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Awɛt in shim in fɛ̀, ke iyit kɛ na ayɛt atomaza ayi fɛ́ a ne azanɛn, a bɛ́ a ki shara yin ifɛ̀ itek ikak zɛɛt ni idɔng fi iyit man ki shara yin ne, won itsɛɛt ishɔt iku ifi ayɛ na ayɛ ni i ku ya! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kyɔn ti fi in mi di fɛ̀ yit, won in tin bang fɛ̀ ane: kɛ akak tsin tɛ ki shara yin Ifɛ̀ ikak zɛɛt ni idɔng fi i mi shan yin, won itsɛɛt ishɔt iku ifi ayɛ na ayɛ ni i ku ya!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />In tsin tsɛt ikɔrɔk nhwyɛ banet a, kɛ in kɔrɔk nhwyɛ Adakunom ɛ? Ke iyin di yin fok, in tsin shim in tɛrɛk banet iyɛ yɛ? Ki in fi in rēn shim in tɛrɛk banet iyɛ, ki in yet asam Anet-Isheshek awo.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adakunom yes aBulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Ábaruneng, imi shim ni i rēn yin fok, ifɛ̀ itek fi in shara, yet idɔng fɛ́ anet awe nye awo. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Imi shan ifɛ̀ me na anet akak awo, kɛ akak wu a di tees ide awo, tit aYeso Kristi ice wu fɛ́ a di tonong ide.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nek iyin man fok yin kusot fi in nye ayame ni nggɔn baYahuda, ni kuri izoot fi in nesek bafi ikuus Adakunom makiyi, fi in tsɛt in fuut iye. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />In tsang ya kashon ni nggɔn baYahuda aza bafi kuzam hom, in bi iyɛ ingash ni rosok amok badakop yit makiyi. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Awɛt ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a di kasa neme ni ites hom, a di yes nek itek wu, ayɛt ishim wu, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />a di tonong Ari wu, nɔng in da shara ifɛ̀ wu ayɛt Ícɛn-iduk, imi tsin in tɔ na anet akak awo. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Kɛ in ngarak sak ni aRushelima nek in tsin di bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsang sot batom-aYeso ashon in awo, tit in di berem sak na Arabiya in da ni in bun na aDamaskos.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ama ayɛ ataat, in ngarak sak na aRushelima nɔng in bin rēn aBitrus, in sot azɔng ni iwu nkɔs kusɔk abe toon. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />In di akak ayɛt batom-aYeso me awo tit aYakubu aruneng aTisa yit. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Won in ki tak yin ashon Adakunom fok, ikyɛng fi in tsin ki jɛk yin ne yet mbɔɔs awo. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ama anɔng, in tse na aSiriya nɛ aKilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ni izen e yɔng, imi ice hom vit anet fɛ́ a di rēn ayɛt bafi ikuus Anet-Isheshek fɛ́ ba se ni mben aJudiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ ba foos kyɛk yet: &lt;&lt;Anet yɔng fɛ́ a tsang ki nesek yit mgbang, a se ni ishara inɔɔk atsak fɛ́ a tsɛt ifuut e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ba tere Adakunom nek imi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Batom-aYeso shan <optbreak /> aBulus ni mbɔk nfaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ama ayɛ kusɔk abe anaas, in ti ngarak sak ni aRushelima, ni kutseet ku kang, in se nɛ aBarnabas, in bereng aTitus. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />In tse azɔng nek Adakunom di tonong fok ni in tse. In nyim na bashɔn ikuus kyɛw, in ka ba tas ishara ifɛ̀ fi in ras Ícɛn-iduk e, kɔn anyɛk fi in se ne kɛ anyɛk fi in mi tsang nye bi sot abap. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ngma ne anɔng, aTitus fi in tse ni iwu, vit akak fɛ́ a ku te mo gbing-gbing fok ma ba ku ya katse, ngma ni fi iwu ne na aGirik. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Kucɛɛt iya katse me ne nek, baruneng mbɔɔs bakak fɛ́ ba nɔɔs nate yit ni nɛt nek i ki inye gang yit, nek na ba ki beseng yin kuwashak fi in bɛ̀ yit ayɛt aKristi Yeso. Ba shim ba ki sak yit ni in sot yit basam, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />iyit ka ba nang yit kawat ko gyet awo, nek in ki tɛnɛng yin mo atsak ifɛ̀ itek e.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba sok fok ba yet agbat e, ke na ba yet akyɛ, nek Adakunom ras ishɔt iyɛrɛ ayisi awo, ba barang ikikak ni itees hom awo. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Awɛt iba ice ba, ba di gyat fok Adakunom mi di nɔɔk kutomong ishara ifɛ̀ itek sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, kyɔn tɛ ba di nɔɔk aBitrus sak na baYahuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Nek Adakunom a nye kutomong na aBitrus tɛ atom aYeso sak na baYahuda, iwu azining e fɛ́ a nye kutomong ni imi tɛ atom aYeso sak ni Ícɛn-iduk. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Izen fɛ́ ba aYakubu nɛ aBitrus nɛ aYohana, iba fɛ́ ba ka ba sok fok tɛ aberek bafi ikuus e, di itek Adakunom fi ira kutomong ni imi, ba ki ki shan yit na aBarnabas ni mbɔk nfa. Ba fɛ̀ ey iyit ni in tseng yit ni Ícɛn-iduk, ni iba tse na baYahuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ikyɛng izining fɛ́ ba shim ni in nye yit yet, ni in yiring yit na bakan, ikyɛng izining e dɔng fi iyɛ hom ngash nek ira me.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus kɔn aBitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBitrus bɛ́ ne Antakiya, in ku kɔn ayisi na ayisi fok ikyɛng fɛ́ a nye se kpaf awo. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Ni imɛsɛng e, a tsang yas gung nɛ bafi ikuus bafi Ícɛn-iduk. Awɛt izen fɛ́ aBitrus di bafi ikuus bafi icɛn baYahuda fɛ́ aYakubu ka ba yirik sak azɔng, nnyim ku yit, a wat a rawu kuyak nɛ bafi Ícɛn-iduk e. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Nek anɔng, ishɛrɛp bafɛ́ aYahuda me kpa nye nggɔn iyɛrɛ ayisi fɛ́ aBitrus se ne. Nggɔn iyɛrɛ ayisi bá me sak ba di te aBarnabas natse.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ni izen fi in di, ikyɛng fɛ́ ba se ne mi wuruk ayɛt atsak ifɛ̀ Adakunom, in fɛ̀ na aBitrus ashon bá ngma ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet afɛ́ aYahuda, awɛt i ne i kuus nggɔn bafi Ícɛn-iduk. Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn shim i di te nyɛng na bafi Ícɛn-iduk fok gbing-gbing fok ma ba nye tɛ baYahuda yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />&lt;&lt;Iyit fi in yet yit baYahuda ni irɔm, da &lt;bafi inɛn Ícɛn-iduk&gt; awo, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />in rēn yit fok, anet kyem a se ikanang ashon Adakunom nek ikuus ntsi awo, tit ni irèn inɔɔk atsak na aYeso Kristi. Nek anɔng, iyit te yit inɔɔk atsak yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, nɔng in bin se yit ikanang shon Adakunom nek inɔɔk atsak yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, dang ikuus ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀, nek vit anet fɛ́ a kyem a sɛ ikanang ashon Adakunom nek inyes yit ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />&lt;&lt;Ki, ni in rèn tsɛt yit ba ki kanang yit ashon Adakunom nek kusot yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, ayɛt anɔng, ba ki se yit tɛ bafi inɛn, anɔng e tonong fok Anet-Isheshek run kama inɛn ɛ? Koba! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ki in ti in kpa inok ikyɛng fi in man fo ide, idɔng tonong fok imi yet anet iburusu ntsi. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ayet ntsi me wu fi in di sak in ku, in di sɛ ihwyet ni itekap nawop ntsi me, nɔng in bi di sɛ kutset ayɛt Adakunom. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Ba mi di tekak gung ne Anet-Isheshek, imi wu in tin yet atset awo, tit Anet-Isheshek wu fɛ́ a se ni kusot ayɛt hom. Kutset fi in se ne ni irɔm kang, in tsin sot nek inɔɔk atsak fi in bɛ̀ na Arim Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a di tonong ishim, a nɔɔk ice wu nek imi. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Imi kyem in wobok itek Adakunom ni ifam awo, nek ke ba fɛ̀ ba kyem ba sɛ kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom nek ikuus ntsi, ki iku Anet-Isheshek sot abap!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Ikuus ntsi kɛ inɔɔk atsak <optbreak /> ne Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Iyin áshɔp ánet aGalati, angan ki ya yin ni nkut ɛ? I man ki tonong yin wɛshɛk fok ba man tekak aYeso Kristi ni kum. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Won in ki nye yin ku rip kazizining kang kyɛk. I kin shan yin Kabik aJɛrɛ nek i nye yin ikyɛng ntsi fɛ̀ yɛ? Kɛ nek inɔɔk atsak ni ikyɛng fi i kin fok yin ɛ? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Iyin yet yin áshɔp fɛ́ ama fi i mi tumung yin ayɛt abik, iyin shim yin i ti bun yin ni irɔm ɛ? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ngma mgbang fi i tsang sɔ yin, in mi sot abap yɔng ɛ? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Adakunom kin ki nɔɔk yin Kabik wu, a ras ntomong abes nate yin nek i inyes ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀ yɛ? Kɛ nek inɔɔk yin atsak ni ikyɛng fi i kin fok yin ɛ?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Yiring yin ni aIbrahim, &lt;&lt;A kin nɔɔk atsak na Adakunom, ba ku te mo i sot kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />In shim ni i rēn yin fok, bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak, iba ba ba yet nnon aIbrahim. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ifɛ̀ Adakunom man tsang di fok Adakunom kanang Ícɛn-iduk ni irèn inɔɔk atsak, nek anɔng fɛ́ a kin di tak ifɛ̀ itek e nanu aIbrahim gyam fok, &lt;&lt;Ngma icɛ́n azatse bi sɛ awɛng nek ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Nek anɔng, ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak na Adakunom, ba da sɛ awɛng gung ni aIbrahim, iwu fɛ́ a kin nɔɔk atsak.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye yɛndɛng ni ikuus ntsi, ba se na awey, nek i se ni ijɛk fok, &lt;&lt;Kawɛy se naton ayɔng fɛ́ da a kyem a nye ngma ikyɛng fi i se ni ijɛk ni fumung ntsi awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />I se wɛshɛk fok, vit anet fɛ́ a kyem a se kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom nek inye ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀, nek, &lt;&lt;Bafi kusot kutabat da ta ice nek inɔɔk atsak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Vit ikyɛng fi imoon ntsi ni inɔɔk atsak, ti i di se ni jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nyes ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀, iwu da sot nek ina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />AKristi mi ki bisik yit ni bɔk awey fi ntsi bɛ́s e, nek iwu shan kawɛy e akuce yit, nek i se ni ijɛk fok, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku tekak ni kum, a mi sot afɛ́ awey.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Anet-Isheshek ki bisik yit, nɔng awɛng fɛ́ ba kin nɔɔk aIbrahim, da bin sot afi Ícɛn-iduk ni irèn Anet-Isheshek aYeso, nɔng nek inɔɔk atsak yit in di sɛ yit kunang Abik fɛ́ Adakunom kin nye kushii me.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzɛɛt ntsi ni kushii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ábaruneng, won in cɛɛt ni iyin naton ikyɛng fi i mi di mɛɛ yin, ke anet tak nsong wu, vit azining akak fɛ́ a kyem na a wobok kucɛɛt e, kɛ na di barang ikikak natoon e ayi, idɔng i se kpaf anɔng. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Di yin, Adakunom kin nye kushii me nang sak ni aIbrahim ni ijaa wu. Da kufumung ijɛk e kin fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Sak ni ijaa&gt;&gt; se nek na banet dot awo, tit &lt;&lt;Sak ni ijaa ngɔn,&gt;&gt; fi itonong fok i se naton anet azining kyɛk, anet e yet Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ikyɛng fi i mi tsin tonong e yet, ntsi me nang fɛ́ ba kin ne ba tonong ama ayɛ anakat anaas ni nsɔk ntaat, in da kyem in wobok irosom kushii fɛ́ Adakunom kin tsang te iko ni ifam awo, in da kyem in yirik kushii me awo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Nek ki iya itekari me fi i se nek ikuus ntsi, ki ikikak ne ni kushii awo, awɛt Adakunom ayɛt itek wu, nɔɔk aIbrahim ide ni irèn kushi.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Wat ki i se anɔng, akyɛ sak ba bɛ́ ni ntsi me yɛ? Ba di barang nek ba di tun ikyɛng fi i yet inɛn wɛshɛk sak ni izen fi ijaa fɛ́ ba kin nye kushii me nek iwu bɛ́. Fok yin, batomaza ba ba kin bɛ́ ni ntsi me, ni irèn anet fɛ́ a kin nyeseng nate Adakunom ne banet. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Anet inyeseng nate, a nyeseng nek kabak kazining kyɛk awo, Adakunom kin nyeseng aziwu.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fi sak Adakunom nɔɔk ntsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Anɔng sot fok, ntsi se ni ifa ni kushii fɛ́ Adakunom nye yɛ? Koba! Nek ki kubɛ́ ntsi kin fi ku bɛ́s ni kutset, ki kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom nes ni ntsi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Awɛt ifɛ̀ Adakunom tonong fok, kazatse kusum ka se na ngamang inɛn, nɔng Adakunom di ki nɔɔk bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak na aYeso Kristi, ikyɛng fi iwu man nye kushii me.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ni inɔɔk atsak tsin rèn resek dang bɛ́, in tsang se yit gak nawop ntsi, ni te kpaf sak izen fɛ́ ba di tonong inɔɔk atsak e. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Nek anɔng, ntsi na fi in sot anek fɛ́ a da ki tsa yit narɔ Anet-Isheshek, nɔng in da bin sɛ yit kusot kutabat ni rèn inɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi irèn inɔɔk atsak mi bɛ́, in ti se yit ni ínek ntsi kong awo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnon Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ngma yin i yet yit nnon Adakunom, ni rèn inɔɔk atsak na Anet-Isheshek aYeso, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />nek ngma yin fɛ́ ba mi ki ra yin abatisma gung na Anet-Isheshek, i mi sok yin nggɔn Anet-Isheshek yɔng. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Nek anɔng, ke na a yet afɛ́ aYahuda, kɛ afɛ́ aGirik, ke asam, ke ayɔng fɛ́ a se washak ayi, ke amatek e, ke abining e ayi, nek ngma yit in yet yit bazining ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Nek i yet yin bafɛ́ Anet-Isheshek, i sot yin izít aIbrahim yɔng, nɛ bafi iya itekari ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ku nye kushii me.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ikyɛng fi in shim in fɛ̀ yet, ke anet iya itekari me rēn yet nggon, a se zɛɛt na asam awo, ngma ni fi ngma nkyɔrɔk e yet nfuu. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />A rēn resek mo nawop bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin kuyɛrɛ nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin ku ta sak izen fɛ́ atek mi sak ninyɛn. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />I se kpaf anɔng, ni izen fi in rēn yet yit nnon, in se yit ni isam nawop nabik fɛ́ na ya igwɔm azatse kang. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Awɛt fi izen e bi i nye kpaf, Adakunom tom na Arim wu sak azatse, ni irèn kutes abining, na nawop ntsi, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />nek na a di bisik bayɔng fɛ́ ba se nawop ntsi me, nɔng in da bin sɛ yit kukyem isot nnon Adakunom. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Nek iyin yet yin nnon wu, Adakunom mi ki tom yin na Kabik Arim wu na ayɛ yin, Kabik e yes, &lt;&lt;Abba! Ada!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Nek anɔng, ngɔn ti i yet asam kong awo, tit arim wu. Nek i yet arim wu, Adakunom mi da sak i sot anet iya itekari me bà.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudaam fɛ́ aBulus bɛ̀ nek <optbreak /> banet aGalati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ayame fi i tsang rēn yin Adakunom awo, in yet yin basam ni bɔk nabannom nakak fɛ́ da na kyem ikyi ikak awo. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng i rēn yin Adakunom, ke ni in fɛ̀, Adakunom ki rēn yin, akyɛ sak i shim i ti bun yin ni bɔk igwɔm nabik azatse kang fɛ́ da na bɛ́ kukyem awo yɛ? Akyɛ sak i shim i ti bun yin ni isam na ko yɛ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Iyin nɔng ites yin nhwyɛ yin ni tosok nnom nkak, ni nfɛn nkak ni izen, nɛ ayɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Iyin di tes yin nnyim, i di se ti ngma mgbang fi in sɔ nek iyin yet abap.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />In ra awon ni yin ábaruneng, kuus yin nggɔn hom, nek imi mi sot ti iyin. Vit inɛn fi i mi di ra yin ne. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Iyin rēn yin fok, nek kurɔk fi ku di daam ko ku ki sak in ki shara yin mo ifɛ̀ itek. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ngma ni fi kurɔk hom ki se yin ti imara ni yin, iyin da i tonong yin ibyɛs kɛ iraye awo. I di shan yin ti in yet atomaza Adakunom, ti imi wu in yet Anet-Isheshek aYeso me ni ice wu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Akyɛ sɛ ifeng yin e yɛ? Imi rēn fok, ki in fi fɛ̀ ni yin ni turung yin ayisi yin ni di nesek yin, ki i fi kyem yin, ki i nye yin anɔng. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Yɔkɔnɔng i mi sot afidang ifa yin nek in ki tas yin atsak ɛ?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Banet e yɔng tsɛt ba sɔ ice yin sak abak bá, ayet nek kuyiring kutek awo, ikyɛng fɛ́ ba tsɛt yet na ba ki kam yin, nɔng i da ka ba nɔɔk yin nhwyɛ yin. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />I se yɛɛt na ba ki nɔk yin nhwyɛ, ki in se ni irèn itek, won ni i se anɔng kaakyi izen, da ma in se gung ni iyin ninyɛn awo. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Naban nnon yin, bayɔng fi in tsin ti in sɔ mgbang tɛ irus ites ma izen fi nse aKristi tonong ni kusot yin, <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />a di se kin in fi in se gung ni yin, ki in shesheng kutɔ hom, nek a di se zii natoon yin.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng imɛɛs naton aHagar nɛ aSara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Di tak yin, iyin fi i shim i kuus yin ntsi, iyin rēn yin ikyɛng fi ntsi me cɛɛt awɛ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Nek i se ni jɛk fok, aIbrahim kin bɛ̀ nnon namatek e nafaa, kazining ka fɛ́ asam abining wu, ka fɛ́ afaa me ne awashak abining wu. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Arim wu fɛ́ a ne na asam abining e, ba kin sɛ ika ni irèn fɛ́ ba di mɛɛ, awɛt arim wu yɔng fɛ́ a ne na awashak abining e, ba kin ku tes nek kushii fɛ́ Adakunom man nye.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ikyɛng deng se tɛ nawu fi in shim in di yit, banyining bafaa me nyeseng naton irosom kushii asa faa me. Irosom kushii kuzining ne ni Ihwyanang aSinai, a bi tes nnon fɛ́ na bi yet basam, ku nyeseng naton aHagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />AHagar nyeseng akuce Ihwyanang aSinai ni mben Arabiya, anɔng e nyeseng naton kuwɔp aRushelima afɛ́ atut, nek a se ni isam ni nnon wu. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Awɛt aRushelima fɛ́ a se naton, ayɔng se washak, iwu fɛ́ a yet nggɔ yit. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Nek i se ni jɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Nye iyɛ ikan, ngɔn akuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ngɔn fi i man tes awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">ta kutɔ gbɛrɛy ni ifeng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Ngɔn fi da i man mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">irus kutes awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">nek nnon abining</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">fɛ́ amatek mi ku won,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">na wat, na fɛ́ abining</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">fɛ́ a se gung ne amatek wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, kpaf ti aIshaku, iyin yet yin nnon kushii fɛ́ Adakunom nye. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ni izen e yɔng, nggon fɛ́ ba tes ni irèn fɛ́ ba mi di mɛɛ me, zoot kayɔng fɛ́ ba tes ni irèn ízɔk abik. Idɔng ites anɔng ni nnu nang. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Awɛt ifɛ̀ Adakunom kin fɛ̀ anɛ? &lt;&lt;Ro yin asam abining e nɛ arim wu, nek arim asam abining da kyem na a ya itekari gung ni nnon abining awashak awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, da iyit yet yit nnon asam abining awo, tit nnon abining awashak e.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Anet-Isheshek <optbreak /> ki bisik yit washak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />I yet nek kusot awashak ko fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek ki bisik yit mo. Nek anɔng, nyeseng yin gak, i bi won yin ba tɛ ba ki rosom yin tɛ basam awo.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Di fok yin, imi aBulus tsin ki tak yin fok, ki i won yin ba ki ya yin katse, i sot fok Anet-Isheshek te kuhwye me yɔng. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />In shim in bang ki tak yin fok, ngma anet fɛ́ a won ba ku ya katse, i sot gbing-gbing na a shining ntsi me ngma kusum. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Iyin fi itsɛt yin kusot kutabat ni irèn ikuus ntsi, i sot i mi kam yin ice yin na Anet-Isheshek yɔng, i mi buruk yin itek Adakunom. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Awɛt nek inɔɔk atsak e, ayɛt agap Kabik, nɔng in di sɛ yit ite iyɛ ni kusot kutabat. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Nek kusot ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, kɛ na ba di ya yit katse, kɛ na ba won dang da ya ayi, iyet kutomong abap. Ikyɛng izining kyɛk fɛ́ ba tsɛt yet, inɔɔk atsak fi itonong ice ye ni irèn ishim.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Iyin tsang tseng yin gyat ni imɛsɛng e, angan wu ki tɛnɛng yin, a ki ro yin ifoos ifɛ̀ atsak e kong ɛ? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kuri ikɔk nhwyɛ in yɔng, in ne na ayɔng fɛ́ a ki yes yin awo. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Kɔn fɛ́ ba di cɛɛt fok: &lt;&lt;Kaba ayist gyegyet, ka sak nkpe alikama dot ni in mos fungam.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />In bi ite iyɛ na aTisa fok, i da shan yin itabak ikak zɛɛt awo. Anet e yɔng fɛ́ a ki tes yin natse, iwu fɛ́ Adakunom da ku tabak, kɛ na a yet angan ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ábaruneng, ki in fin shara ifɛ̀ naton iya katse, akyɛ sak fɛ́ ba rēn di nesek izoot ɛ? Ki ishara ifɛ̀ naton iku aYeso Kristi naton ikum sot ikyɛng ikpa na akak awo. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />A di se ke bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki boroso yin e, ke ba wat tɛsɛng kashon bá me, ba di sot amaring.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ábaruneng, iyin ba mi ki yes yin sak kusot washak, awɛt da kusot washak e sak ni inyes ikyɛng fi nggɔn inɛn shim awo, tit sak ni i di sɛs yin bafidang ayɛt ishim. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ntsi ngma kusum ba kunung ina ayɛt ifɛ̀ izining de, &lt;&lt;Shim afidang isot ngɔn ti ice ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ki i ya yin kashon ni iros yin, ni sarak yin bafidang, nɔ yin nhwyɛ yin kɔn i bi man yin ace yin.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzɛɛt Kabik Adakunom <optbreak /> ni nggɔn irɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Nek anɔng in shim in fɛ̀ ane, nye yin kusot ayɛt abik Adakunom, na anɔng fi i di ki nɔɔk yin ishim kusot ni inɛn kawat awo. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Nek kusot ni ishim inɛn tsɛsɛk nkyɔrɔk fi in se kangang ni kushim abik Adakunom, nɛ Kabik tsɛsɛk nkyɔrɔk fi in se kangang ni kushim ishim kusot ni inɛn. Ba se ni ifa na bafidang, nek anɔng fi da kyem ira yin ikyɛng fi ishim yin awo. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Awɛt ke Kabik Adakunom ka, ka tsin da kɔk, ngɔn ti i se nawop ntsi awo.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ntomong ishim kusot irɔm se ni dɛt wɛshɛk, tɛ ane: Ira kujang ni nkyɔrɔk agbɛk-gbɛk, ni kuduk isot, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />ni iya nabannom ntong, ni ya nkut, ni iraye banet, ni kam kusot banet, ni ifup ni iyɛ ife. Ni ishim ice, ni ikam ice na bafidang, ni ikabasa ni ishim ice <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ni iraye iya kashon bakak, ni ifeng isɔs ngbere, ni ites ares shaam, ni ishɛrɛp nkyɔrɔk kuri inang. In ki kɔrɔk yin kuto, ti fi in ma ki nye e yame, fok bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye kuri nggɔn nɔng, ba bi nɔ ni iya itekari igwɔm Adakunom awo.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Awɛt nggɔn fi in nes na Kabik Adakunom yet: ishim, ni iyɛ ikan, ni kukyang, akabɔk, ni nhwyɛ, ni itek, ni itonong atsak, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ni kusot kuhwyɛ, ni iyit nhwyɛ. Nkyɔrɔk ti nnang, vit ishɔt naton na. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso ba mi tekak ishim kusot inɛn, ni ikɔk itsɛsɛk de. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Nek in se yit ayɛt abik, won ni in kuus yit ikyɛng fɛ́ Kabik e tees. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />In bi nye yit kukaa, ni idoro nhwyɛ ni iraye iya kashon bakak awo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Sɛs yin bafidang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Ábaruneng, ki i iyit yin akak ni inɛn, iyin fi ise yin ni nggɔn abik Adakunom, bun yin ni wu ni irèn ayɛt nhwyɛ. Awɛt nye yin yɛɛt ni ice yin, kɔng iyin ba ni di kpas yin ni imara me bá. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Di sɛs yin bafidang ni ndaam bà, nek ayet anɔng e me fi i di ki shining yin itees Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ke akak di fok iwu kyem ikikak, da a ne a kyem e awo, a tsin wɔrɔk ice wu. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Won kaangan na a mas nggɔn wu a da di, na anɔng wu fɛ́ a di ki nye kukaa ni ice wu, da nek imaas ice wu ne akak awo, <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />nek kaangan mi sok acet wu.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a mi shan itabak ifɛ̀ Adakunom, won na kaba ngma ikyɛng itek fɛ́ a sɛ na ayɔng fɛ́ a ku tees mo.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />I bi wɔrɔk yin ice yin awo, vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a tonong Adakunom itsɛ́ng. Ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ anet tup, ide fɛ́ a da tusung. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a tuus nek a di tɛrɛk ishim irɔm wu iyɛ, ayɛt ishim irɔm e ye fɛ́ a bi tusung ikyɛng fi i bi ku tsa sak iku; awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a tuus nek a di tɛrɛk Kabik Adakunom iyɛ, a bi tusung ice wu kutset vit nkum. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Won in bi rɔn yit ayɛt iras ntomong ntek awo, nek na akpaf izen, in bi tusung yit nkyɔrɔk ntek ki da in rɔn yit awo. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Nek anɔng, ki in sɛ yit izen, won in nye itek sak na banet ngma kusum, amak e bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni irèn ikuus.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak igang e gung ni te ashow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Di yin atin ijɛk aratek fi in tsin ki jɛk yin ne ni kubɔk hom!<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsɛt ba di te gbing-gbing fok ba ki ya yin katse, ba nye anɔng fok ba di tsot kukaa. Ikyɛng fi i sak ba di nye anɔng yet nek nnyim kɔng ba bi ka ba nɔɔk izoot nek kucɛɛt itekak Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Vit akak ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba ya katse me ice bá fɛ́ a nyes ikyɛng fi ntsi me fɛ̀, ngma na anɔng na ba di ban fok na ba ki ya yin katse, nɔng ba bin sɛ ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di ki tsot kukaa ni irɔm yin. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ko ni kuro, won kukaa hom bi se ni ikikak awo tit ni itekak aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, ni wu fɛ́ ba mi tekak kazatse ni mi, ba mi di tekak imi na kazatse. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ke iya katse, ke vit iya katse yet ikikak awo. Ikyɛng fɛ́ ba tsɛt kyɛk yet inye ifas. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Won kusot kukyang nɛ angmishish, na a sot afɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba kuus itabak yeng, sak ni aIsrela Adakunom.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ni igang e, da akak bi di sak kudaam awo, nek kurɔm hom ngma kusum, ku bi izizɔ fi in ses nek aYeso.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Ábaruneng, won itek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni i sot ayɛt abik yin. Anɔng.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>